title: FirstVillager
---
<<declare $hasChosenName = false>>
<<declare $playerName = "">>
<<if $hasChosenName == false>>
Villager: Oh, you're awake.

Villager: You look a little confused.

Villager: Do you remember your name?

<<enter_player_name GameManager>>
<<set $hasChosenName = true>>

{$playerName}: My name is {$playerName}. //Player can be used as a fixed name in the beginning

Villager: {$playerName}...

Villager: Yes, that suits you.

Villager: It's good to meet you, {$playerName}.
<<else>>
    
Villager: Ah, {$playerName}. Good to see you again.

<<endif>>
===